Rāvaṇa orders Hanumān killed in anger --- Vibhīṣaṇa disapproves envoy killing --- Vibhīṣaṇa cites disfigurement beating shaving as lawful penalties --- Vibhīṣaṇa praises Rāvaṇa unequal among gods --- Vibhīṣaṇa warns killing bars luring princes to battle --- Vibhīṣaṇa urges sending part force to seize princes